<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-RBA makes no announcement on Australia rates.</title>
<headline>RTRS-RBA makes no announcement on Australia rates.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of Australia (RBA) made no announcement on official interest rates at its regular morning money market operation on Wednesday.</p>
<p>There had been speculation in financial markets the central bank would cut official interest rates following the monthly meeting of its policy board on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Rates were last cut on November 6, when the official cash rate was reduced to 6.5 percent from 7.0 percent.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
